# r1114 rerun of fix_c2a1's batch faults ROLL-11, BBQ2-05 (verdicts: perf/runs/r1114/verdicts/fix_c2a1.md). Same world
# as fix_c2a1 (scratch dir .../scratchpad/fixc2a1, level fixc2a1, probes zc2/zp/zact/zq still in srv/kubejs); a fresh
# prep_srv.sh OUT fixc2a1 A spawn-animals=true with the fix_c2a1 probe copies works too.
# Fix: the +4 food on every eat was peaceful-difficulty hunger regen (+1 food per 10 ticks while the player needs food,
#   Player.aiStep), accrued over the 2 s (pace 1: hold, eat) between "zp hunger" and "zp eat". naturalRegeneration
#   false stops it; the bread control stays to prove the offset is gone. ROLL-11's golden roll now eats from 0 (from 4
#   any nutrition >= 16 capped at 20).
pace 1

## SQ-C2-00 | setup: gamerules, bot (not a test row)
> forceload add 296 290 360 380
> gamerule doMobSpawning false
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> gamerule naturalRegeneration false
> time set noon
> weather clear
> pbot spawn c2b 300 -60 296 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> clear c2b
> zp inv c2b
waitlog \[zp\] done 20
reject \[zc2\] error|\[zp\] error

## SQ-ROLL-11 | golden roll +20, slice +10 hunger; not eaten at full hunger; control eat (bread 5) shows no offset
> effect clear c2b
> zp hunger c2b 0
> pbot hold c2b minecraft:bread 1
> zp eat c2b
> effect clear c2b
> zp hunger c2b 0
> pbot hold c2b roll_delight:golden_roll_slice 1
> zp eat c2b
> effect clear c2b
> zp hunger c2b 0
> pbot hold c2b roll_delight:golden_roll 1
> zp eat c2b
> zp hunger c2b 20
> pbot hold c2b roll_delight:golden_roll 1
> zq useitem c2b
waitlog useitem c2b 20
expect \[zp\] eat c2b 1 minecraft:bread: .*food 5,
expect \[zp\] eat c2b 1 roll_delight:golden_roll_slice: .*food 10,
expect \[zp\] eat c2b 1 roll_delight:golden_roll: .*food 20,
expect \[zq\] useitem c2b FAIL
look bread reads food 5 (if 9 again, the offset is not peaceful regen: find it before judging); Nourishment 2400t on slice and roll is the comfort_nourishment golden rule, not a fault
> effect clear c2b
> clear c2b

## SQ-BBQ2-05 | kebab wrap, kebab sandwich, bibimbap hunger, no skewer effects (effects cleared before each eat)
> effect clear c2b
> zp hunger c2b 2
> pbot hold c2b barbequesdelight:kebab_wrap 1
> zp eat c2b
> effect clear c2b
> zp hunger c2b 2
> pbot hold c2b barbequesdelight:kebab_sandwich 1
> zp eat c2b
> effect clear c2b
> zp hunger c2b 2
> pbot hold c2b barbequesdelight:bibimbap 1
> zp eat c2b
waitlog \[zp\] eat c2b 1 barbequesdelight:bibimbap 20
expect \[zp\] eat c2b 1 barbequesdelight:kebab_wrap: .*food 12,
expect \[zp\] eat c2b 1 barbequesdelight:kebab_sandwich: .*food 18,
expect \[zp\] eat c2b 1 barbequesdelight:bibimbap: .*food 18,
look effects: only an ambient Raspberry Pie diet effect (800t, e.g. Speed after enough foods) may show; any other effect the food gave is a FAIL
> effect clear c2b
> clear c2b
